#: ui/compare/classifier_pipeline_editor_qt.py:846
msgid ""
"This condition matches (True) when the downstream file count with this suffix is BELOW this threshold -- i.e. \"room "
"to generate more\", not \"a related file was found\". With the default of 1, that means it matches when the count is "
"0 -- no matching file exists yet. This is the opposite of what \"Related Image Exists\" might suggest at a glance: "
"True here means the image does NOT exist (yet), which is exactly the polarity generate-node AND conditions need (True"
" = clear to generate)."
msgstr ""

