"pipelines typically uncheck this, so True instead means no file with this base stem exists yet in the target "
"directory -- \"this category still needs generating\", not \"a duplicate was found\". Match this condition's polarity"
" to whatever the rest of the node's AND conditions expect (e.g. True = clear to generate)."
